# This Is Not a Safe Space — Site Spec v1

**Type:** Culture/entertainment media site
**Scope:** 5 pages for launch
**Content model:** Full CMS-driven (articles published on an ongoing basis)
**Status:** Handoff spec for development — pair with the wireframes shared alongside this doc

---

## 1. Site map

1. Home
2. Content Hub (archive/browse)
3. Article Detail (single post template)
4. About
5. Contact / Contribute

---

## 2. Recommended stack

- **CMS:** Headless CMS (Sanity, Contentful, or Storyblok) — culture/entertainment content is visual-heavy, so pick a CMS with strong native image handling and responsive image pipelines (all three qualify; Sanity's image CDN and hotspot cropping is a good fit if art direction on thumbnails matters).
- **Frontend:** Next.js (or similar SSR/SSG framework) — needed for SEO on article pages and fast image-heavy grids.
- **Rationale:** Article Detail and Content Hub both consume the same `Article` content type, so the schema needs to be finalized before either page's frontend logic is built.

---

## 3. Content model

### Article
| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| title | string | required |
| slug | string | auto from title, editable |
| category | reference | Film / Music / Nightlife / etc. |
| tags | array of strings | multi-select |
| featured image | image | required, drives card + hero + OG image |
| excerpt | text | ~160 char, used in cards + meta description |
| body | rich text / block content | CMS-native rich text |
| author | reference | see Author type |
| publish date | datetime | |
| related articles | array of references | manual override; fallback to auto (same category) |

### Author
| Field | Type |
|---|---|
| name | string |
| avatar | image |
| bio | text |
| social links | array |

### Category
| Field | Type |
|---|---|
| name | string |
| slug | string |
| description | text (optional, for category landing SEO) |

